  <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Columbia, Pennsylvania</p><h1>Every street should feel safe to walk.</h1><p>ColumbiaWalks gives residents a simple way to document sidewalk hazards, unsafe crossings, aggressive driving, accessibility barriers, and other concerns—right where they happen.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="{{@site.url}}/report/">Report a walking concern</a><a class="button app-button" href="#android-app">Get the app</a><a class="button secondary" href="#mission">Learn how it works</a></div></div>
